---
// Mirrors the getTodo handler and the real output in the post (status 400, two body lines).
---
<figure class="gp14c">
  <div class="gp14c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 270" role="img" aria-label="A handler calls http.Error for a bad id and has no return, so it keeps running and calls http.Error again for not found. The client sees status 400 and a body with both messages.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Without return, the handler keeps going</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Không có return, handler cứ chạy tiếp</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="44" width="420" height="52" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="36" y="66" class="b">http.Error(w, "id must be a number", 400)</text>
    <text x="36" y="86" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>writes status 400 and the first message</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghi status 400 và thông báo đầu tiên</tspan></text>

    <rect x="20" y="122" width="420" height="40" rx="6" class="own" />
    <text x="36" y="147" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>no return: the next lines still run</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không có return: các dòng sau vẫn chạy</tspan></text>

    <rect x="20" y="188" width="420" height="52" rx="6" class="bad" />
    <text x="36" y="210" class="b">http.Error(w, "todo not found", 404)</text>
    <text x="36" y="230" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>status is already sent, but the text is written</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>status đã gửi đi, nhưng chữ vẫn bị ghi thêm</tspan></text>

    <line x1="444" x2="494" y1="70" y2="70" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="502,70 493,65 493,75" class="ah" />
    <line x1="444" x2="494" y1="214" y2="214" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="502,214 493,209 493,219" class="ah" />

    <rect x="506" y="44" width="374" height="196" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="522" y="70" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>What the client receives</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Client nhận được</tspan></text>
    <text x="522" y="104" class="num"><tspan data-lang-en>status 400</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>status 400</tspan></text>
    <text x="522" y="134"><tspan data-lang-en>body line 1: id must be a number</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dòng body 1: id must be a number</tspan></text>
    <text x="522" y="164" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>body line 2: todo not found</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dòng body 2: todo not found</tspan></text>
    <text x="522" y="198" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>The server also logs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Server còn ghi log</tspan></text>
    <text x="522" y="218" class="m">superfluous response.WriteHeader call</text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The 404 never reaches the client as a status. Only its text does, glued onto the 400 response.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Status 404 không bao giờ tới client. Chỉ có chữ của nó, dính thêm vào response 400.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp14c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp14c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp14c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp14c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp14c .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp14c .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp14c .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp14c .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp14c .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp14c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp14c .own { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp14c .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp14c .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp14c .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp14c .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp14c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
